sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cli as Client
    participant OA as Origin A
    participant RS as Stream Redis
    participant RC as Sub Redis h
    participant OB as Slot owner B
    participant Recv as Receiver
    Cli->>OA: POST events/abc + body
    OA->>RS: append.lua · durable write to events/abc
    RS-->>OA: committed append result
    Note over OA: OnStreamAppend enqueues one path locally<br/>no Redis call
    OA-->>Cli: 204 · byte committed · hint recorded
    Note over OA,RC: dirty worker: occupied bitmap → pipelined fanout sets<br/>hydrate sub-1 · batch linked tails
    OA->>RC: arm_wake.lua · generation++ · ZADD due now
    OA->>Recv: POST signed wake · async worker delivers
    Recv-->>OA: 200 {done:true}
    OA->>RC: ack.lua · cursor → tail · ZREM due
    Note over RC,OB: Slot owner finds the due set empty<br/>nothing owed · no redundant delivery
